WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A ring hangs from a thread. Its holder feels still, yet the metal begins to move.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Is the answer coming from somewhere outside the hand? In eighteen thirty-three, Chevreul made the pendulum

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
a question for experiment, not a shortcut to certainty. Modern researchers have tested whether such movements reveal hidden knowledge.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
One study reported an advantage. A later pendulum study did not reproduce it.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Experience can be real while its explanation is mistaken. Before buying an audio program,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
ask the same question: which specific benefits have actually been tested?
